--!strict
-- @tier T0
-- VfxLibrary: 21 neutral vfx/1 presets named by function (what the effect communicates), never by
-- theme. Colours are palette roles and textures are built-ins plus a texture role, so a game
-- re-skins every preset by passing its palette and its approved textures to Vfx.build.
-- Budgets (conventions, docs/presentation.md): authored rate <= 100/s per emitter (the mobile
-- cap), <= 200 peak particles and <= 400 overdraw per preset, light range <= 16, no shadow-casting
-- lights, flash = true on anything that lights up a large area (dropped under reduceFlashing),
-- motion = true on screen-motion effects (skipped under reducedMotion).
-- Texture roles a game can map: spark, soft, smoke, ring, streak, confetti, glow, beam.
-- Sounds name default AVKit/AudioCues cues.
local VfxLibrary = {}

VfxLibrary.SCHEMA = "vfx/1"

local FADE_OUT = { { 0, 0 }, { 1, 1 } }
local SHRINK = function(size: number): any
	return { { 0, size }, { 1, 0 } }
